          "id": 586445630,
          "type": null,
          "body": "Hi,\n\nI download the night build for windows [Wireshark-win64-3.5.0rc0-1996-g4bd80d551bea.msi](https://www.wireshark.org/download/automated/win64/Wireshark-win64-3.5.0rc0-1996-g4bd80d551bea.msi) . and find there is error when display the opus [sip-rtp-opus-hybird.pcap](https://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/uploads/b94fd091a3c2b0563487da61e189cf1e/sip-rtp-opus-hybird.pcap). The error cause from the array for `proto_tree_add_bitmask_list()` not end with `NULL`.\n\nPlease help to review this change. Thanks",
